      "id": "ppj-exec-summary",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "TD_TechnicalKnowledgePlatform_v2.1.0\n\nDomain:\nFabric / Textiles Technique\n\nLifecycle:\nDevelopment / Data Validation\n\nProgress:\nETL completed for currently identified v2.1 sources\n\nGate:\nSync validation and canonical technical model\n\nOutcome:\nTechnical Data Backbone for Pattern, BOM, Consumption, Construction, documents and historical records; upstream source for Costing, Sew Agent, BOM, Consumption, Pattern, Technical Search and Similar Style.\n\nTop Blocker:\nSync reliability\n\nNext Milestone:\nImplement incremental sync, error handling and retry\n\nLast Verified:\n2026-09-18",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -90,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ppj-management-attention",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "KEY MANAGEMENT ATTENTION\n\nTop Risks\n- Sync reliability\n- Version governance\n- Missing keys and duplicate records\n\nDecisions Needed\n- None recorded\n\nExternal Dependencies\n- Technical sources -> ETL -> Technical Data Layer -> Sync -> Platform -> Costing / Pattern / Wash / Search",
